# Khan, Vengeful Heart: "You may cast this card from exile" (CR 113.6e, 601.3), a static ability that functions while the
# card is in exile, so the card itself offers the cast there. Bot1 casts Khan on turn 1 (Lotus for three black, a Mox Jet
# for the fourth) and declines the enters sacrifice, keeping the Moxen. Bot2's Swords to Plowshares exiles him on turn 2 and
# Bot1 gains 5 life (CR 119.3). On turn 3 four untapped Moxen pay {2}{B}{B} exactly, so Khan must be castable from exile and
# returns to the battlefield, where his enters ability is offered again.

